  "prefLabel": "Sw 203.01 Failure to Comply with Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 203.01 Failure to Comply with Rules. Failure to comply with Sw 200 shall result in the commission:\n\n(a) Refusing to accept a non-compliant document for filing;\n\n(b) Denying or conditionally denying a non-compliant application or request; or\n\n(c) Issuing an order adverse to a non-compliant person.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Sw 200) #12093, eff 1-27-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw200.html"
